OL,3,GNEWSAWaste firm's illegal wood posed
OL,4,A'serious fire risk'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA waste management firm posed a
OL,7,F"significant fire risk" to nearby homes
OL,8,Fand businesses by having more than 10
OL,9,Ftimes as much wood as it was allowed to
OL,10,Fhandle, a court has heard.
OL,12,FThe Environment Agency (EA) visited CLC
OL,13,FUtilities in Wallsend multiple times in
OL,14,F2021 and 2022 and repeatedly flagged
OL,15,Ftheir concerns to the managers,
OL,16,Fbrothers Gary and John Cook, Newcastle
OL,17,FCrown Court heard.
OL,19,FRecord Andrew Latimer said the firm had
OL,20,Fgiven itself an "unfair" advantage over
OL,21,Fcompetitors and a fire would have
OL,22,Fcaused major damage.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
