OL,3,GNEWSAWaste firm's illegal wood posed
OL,4,A'serious fire risk'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBoth Cooks admitted operating a
OL,7,Fregulated facility without a permit
OL,8,Fover a 16-month period and were each
OL,9,Fordered to complete unpaid work.
